# SEO optimization (must)

Ship SEO with every public landing. Do not leave title-only metadata.

## Required files

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| Helpers | `src/lib/seo.ts` (`buildMetadata`, JSON-LD builders) |
| JSON-LD | `src/components/seo/JsonLd.tsx` |
| Robots | `src/app/robots.ts` |
| Sitemap | `src/app/sitemap.ts` |
| Site config | `src/config/site.ts` (url, description, keywords) |

## Metadata (layout or page)

Use `buildMetadata()` for:

- `metadataBase` from `site.url`
- Title template + description + keywords
- Canonical
- Open Graph + Twitter (`summary_large_image`)
- Robots index/follow + googleBot image preview
- Icons (brand favicon)

## Structured data

Inject via `JsonLd` in root layout:

- Organization
- WebSite
- Product (or Offer) when the landing sells products

Copy: no em/en dashes. Keep `site.url` accurate per brand.

## Checklist

- [ ] `site.url` / description / keywords filled
- [ ] OG image is a real local asset path
- [ ] `/robots.txt` and `/sitemap.xml` resolve
- [ ] JSON-LD present in HTML source
- [ ] New public routes added to sitemap
